# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to checkin Pipfile.lock into version control.
#   However, in some cases, you may wish to ignore it.
#   Pipfile.lock

# Poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to checkin poetry.lock into version control.
#   This is a personal preference depending on whether you want to build a library or an application.
#   poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Poetry, it is generally recommended to checkin pdm.lock into version control.
